import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
---
<LegalPage title="Returns & refunds" description="Returns for accessories and refunds for digital files.">
  <h2>Accessories</h2>
  <p>Return policy for physical products to be defined with the fulfilment partners before the first accessory goes on sale (EU/UK buyers get at least the legal 14-day withdrawal right).</p>
  <h2>3D files</h2>
  <p>Our refund policy for digital files is being finalised. If a file does not match what its listing describes, email us and we will make it right.</p>
  <h2>EU / UK right of withdrawal</h2>
  <p>At checkout you agree that the download starts immediately and acknowledge you lose the 14-day withdrawal right once the download begins.</p>
  <h2>Print failures</h2>
  <p>Print problems caused by printer setup are not refundable, but we will help you dial it in.</p>
</LegalPage>
